{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124556","id":4893405846,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABI6tylg","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124556","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124556.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124556.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124556","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124556/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124556/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124556/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f37c94276c58ec990fbfdc28ad6201c936e68c19","number":124556,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"D3D12: Report device removal and implement GPU breadcrumbs via DRED","user":{"login":"alankuras","id":25343643,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MzQzNjQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25343643?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alankuras","html_url":"https://github.com/alankuras","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alankuras/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alankuras/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alankuras/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alankuras/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alankuras/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alankuras/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alankuras/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alankuras/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alankuras/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\n\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\n\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\n-->\n\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\n\n- Closes:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15661\n\n## Additional information\n\n<!--\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\n-->\nPoints for reviewers:\n\n- **No crash on detection.** Vulkan does `CRASH_NOW_MSG` after printing. This keeps D3D12's current behavior (functions return errors) so projects that handle device loss themselves keep working. Happy to crash instead if that's preferred for consistency,\n- **Opt-in switch.** DRED rides on `--accurate-breadcrumbs`, which only exists in debug/dev builds.\n- **Duplicated name table.** The breadcrumb-marker-to-string switch is copied from the Vulkan driver. It could move to a shared helper in `RenderingDeviceDriver` in a follow-up,\n- Breadcrumbs are only inserted where `RenderingDeviceGraph` inserts them (draw list begin), as on Vulkan,\n- The command line docs page in godot-docs says breadcrumbs are Vulkan-only.\n\nTesting:\nThis patch helped me to find the root cause of the driver crash in my project. Attached example of a log. Happy to share more if needed.\n\n### AI disclosure\n\nThe patch was written with an AI coding assistant.it read the Vulkan and D3D12 drivers, wrote the change, ported it to master, built and ran it. I reviewed the diff, decided the scope and the behavior questions above, and tested it on my machine.\n[msaa8-dred.log](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33570695/msaa8-dred.log)\n","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-16T19:42:13Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T08:44:08Z","closed_at":"2026-10-16T19:51:02Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"0ed06eb167a299f7e306f834c00eb6b82e2383d5","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"alankuras:d3d12-dred","ref":"d3d12-dred","repo":null,"sha":"f37c94276c58ec990fbfdc28ad6201c936e68c19","user":{"login":"alankuras","id":25343643,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MzQzNjQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25343643?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alankuras","html_url":"https://github.com/alankuras","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alankuras/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alankuras/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alankuras/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alankuras/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alankuras/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alankuras/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alankuras/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alankuras/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alankuras/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},"base":{"label":"godotengine:master","ref":"master","repo":{"id":15634981,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkxNTYzNDk4MQ==","name":"godot","full_name":"godotengine/godot","owner":{"login":"godotengine","id":6318500,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjYzMTg1MDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6318500?v